# Root build context for apps/web/Dockerfile (built with repo root as context).
# Keep the context small + stable so the pnpm-install layer caches well.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
cdk.out

# Other workspaces / non-web source: not needed to build apps/web, and
# excluding them keeps the context small. (apps/web's only workspace dep is
# packages/api-client.) infra/cdk/package.json is the exception — it must stay
# so `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` sees a complete, lockfile-matching
# workspace (nested re-include so only the manifest survives).
apps/api
apps/agent
infra/*
!infra/cdk
infra/cdk/*
!infra/cdk/package.json

# VCS + local secrets. **/.env* is critical: a stray apps/web/.env.local in the
# context would otherwise shadow the NEXT_PUBLIC_* build args at `next build`.
.git
.github
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
